      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The database offers:\n\nAn innovative search e. g. by building type, volumetric constellations or even urban design context is possible. For licensing reasons, access to the Birkhäuser Building Types online database is restricted to the ethz.ch domain. Non-members of ETH Zurich can use it on ETH-Bibliothek premises.\n\nBirkhäuser Building Types online"
